Well, DECwrite (at least the early releases, not sure about the latest) were
written for DEC by Frame.  So there may be some compatibility in file formats
betwwen the two.

If DECwrite outputs to PostScript or RTF (MS Word) format you may be able to
save your files in one of these formats, transfer them to the Mac, and import
them into another package.

Take a look at Interleaf's Mac product.  The last major release was in the 3.x
