A couple of weeks ago, I posted a query about third-party disks for the
DECStation 3100.  Having received all the responses I think I can expect,
I hereby summarize the responses and other information I have discovered
about the subject.

First of all, thanks to the following net.residents for taking the time
to respond:

   "Jason Berri" <xberri@arecibo.aero.org>
   Douglas A. Brune <brune@luther.che.wisc.edu>
