           1)  We are on annual allocation - I refuse to charge out
                  by the drink (cost of accounting is too high)

           2)  We generally buy the workstations: that way we can shift
                  resources rapidly

           3)  We buy the software for which there is consensus
                  anything else is negotiated

    For the other groups:
 
           An annual chargout rate by month is established based on
                  histroical usage.

We support nearly a dozen workstations, about the same number of
X-terminals, an additional 30 or so VAXs, and something on the order of
100 pcs.  Our support staff is 2 1/2 people.  And fortunately there are
