That I received no responses indicates one of several things:
(a) it can't be done, (b) it can be done but no one who reads
the newsgroup knows how, (c) it can be done and people know
how, but no one bothered to tell me how.

I did speak to a friend who knows Ultrix pretty well and who
indicated that it just can't be done.  But he offered a workaround.
The workaround is that under Ultrix, unlike SunOS, one can
export subdirectories of already-exported directories or file
systems.  I will take this route, and export the subdirectories
with root access to the few machines I want to have that feature.
Many thanks to bill@soil.Princeton.EDU for offering this workaround.

