--

VMS does support mixed version clusters, however they can't be more than
1 "dot" release from each other.  You could cluster V4.7 and V5.0 systems
(however the VAXstation wasn't supported until V5.1-B so that won'thelp)

You could consider installing DFS services on the VAXstation and mounting
the DFS disk on the larger machine.  (at least until you can get your 780
up to a higher number version of VMS)


