>Can someone, preferably inside DEC, tell me what the differences are
>between so-called workstation and server models of what appear to be
>the same machine.
>
>We are currently investigating a machine to act primarilly as an NFS
>server and we are looking at the new DSY5/240 and DS5000/240.  We
>want to put a prestoserve board in the machine and would put 32Mb of
>RAM in the DS5000.  When one configures them to the same level, the
