user-level access only for the rest for a particular file system or
directory?  Under SunOS, you do this:

	/usr	-root=foo1,access=foo2:foo3:foo4

What is the syntax for the equivalent thing under Ultrix 4.2?
The man page was not helpful in this regard, I did not see a
discussion of this in the Ultrix 4.2 Release notes, and I have
not been successful in the various incantations I have experimented
with.  Can someone help me please?  Thanks.

