According to my VAX-11/750 Maintenance Handbook, the registers can be
read/controlled from the console. Listed addresses are:

FFF460		Bus address register
FFF462		Bus data register
FFF464		CR1*
FFF466		IPEC, CR2, UET PROM data register

* CR<0> NPR (GO) bit
  CR<2:1> <C1:C0> from control bits
  CR<4:3> <A17:A16> bus address bits

  <C1> <C0> Function
   0    0   DATI
   0    1   DATIP
   1    0   DATO
   1    1   DATOB
